    "title": "Center Moriches Man Indicted for 1984 Lynbrook Murder - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hank Russell ,\n3 hours ago A Center Moriches man was indicted on murder charges for the death of a 16-year-old girl near a roller-skating rink in Lynbrook more than 40 years ago. Richard Bilodeau, 63, was arraigned on October 15, 2025, before Judge Helene Gugerty on grand jury indictment charges of Murder in the Second Degree (Intentional Murder) (a Class A-I felony) and Murder in the Second Degree (During the Course of a Rape). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
